p><p><strong>The Grady County county clerk records Oklahoma deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in Grady County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.gradycountyok.com/195/County-Clerk' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Grady County Clerk</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on the official page</h2><ul><li>County site has County Clerk Fee Schedule page (page body did not render in scrape) (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Grady County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Grady County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>Grady County by the numbers</h2><p>The Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey counts 55,868 people and 23,332 housing units in Grady County, which ranks 13 of 27 ok counties here. Median home value is $187,900, which is 14% above the middle county in this ok set. Households here earn a median $75,730; the middle ok county is at $60,482. 25% of occupied homes are rented, which leaves 75% owner-occupied. The median home was built in 1981, about 42 years ago.</p><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-property-tax-guide/'>Oklahoma Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-homestead-exemption/'>Oklahoma Homestead Exemption Guide</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-estate-tax/'>Oklahoma Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-oklahoma/'>We buy houses in Oklahoma</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.gradycountyok.com/195/County-Clerk' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Grady County Clerk</a></li><li><a href='https://oklahoma.gov/tax.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Oklahoma Tax Commission</a></li><li><a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Oklahoma Legislature</a></li></ul><p><em>This is general information about Grady County, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Oklahoma\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-oklahoma/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Grady County county clerk\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/grady-county-ok-county-clerk/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Grady County, OK County Clerk Guide", "rank_math_description": "Grady County, OK county clerk: where to record a deed, real estate transfer ta