p-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>McClain County, OK County Clerk: Recording a Deed, Fees and Transfer Tax</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Oklahoma</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>McClain County, OK County Clerk: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a McClain County, OK County Clerk sale</li><li>Turn the McClain County, OK County Clerk offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling in McClain County? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy McClain County houses as-is and reply with a written cash offer.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>The McClain County county clerk records Oklahoma deeds and mortgages.</strong></p><h2>Who records deeds in McClain County</h2><ul><li><a href='https://mcclain-co-ok.us/offices/mcclain-county-clerk/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>McClain County Clerk</a> records deeds and mortgages.</li></ul><h2>What we confirmed on the official page</h2><ul><li>Standard recording fee $18.00 first page ($8 recording + $10 preservation) plus $2.00 each additional page; nonconforming documents $25 first page, $10 each additional page plus $10 preservation fee</li><li>Documentary stamp tax $0.75 per $500 of purchase price when consideration exceeds $100; proof of price must accompany deed</li><li>Land records search on vendor domain okcountyrecords.com (indexed from April 1981) (from the county site listing; confirm with the office)</li></ul><h2>Fees</h2><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in McClain County?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy McClain County houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><h2>What we could not confirm</h2><ul><li>Due dates/delinquency interest not on opened McClain page (statewide 12/31 and 3/31 rule only seen on other counties' pages)</li></ul><h2>Mcclain County by the numbers</h2><p>The Census Bureau's 2019-2023 survey counts 43,779 people and 17,125 housing units in Mcclain County, which ranks 21 of 27 ok counties here. Median home value is $233,900, which is 42% above the middle county in this ok set. Households here earn a median $84,778; the middle ok county is at $60,482. 22% of occupied homes are rented, which leaves 78% owner-occupied.</p><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-property-tax-guide/'>Oklahoma Property Tax Guide: Appeals</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-homestead-exemption/'>Oklahoma Homestead Exemption Guide</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-estate-tax/'>Oklahoma Estate and Inheritance Tax</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-oklahoma/'>We buy houses in Oklahoma</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://mcclain-co-ok.us/offices/mcclain-county-clerk/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>McClain County Clerk</a></li><li><a href='https://oklahoma.gov/tax.html' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Oklahoma Tax Commission</a></li><li><a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>Oklahoma Legislature</a></li></ul><p><em>This is general information about Mcclain County, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"Li